{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24907","headline":"观南郊回仗 · 薛存诚","name":"观南郊回仗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"传警千门寂，南郊彩仗回。\n但惊龙再见，谁识日双开。\n德泽施云雨，恩光变烬灰。\n阅兵貔武振，听乐凤皇来。\n候刻移宸辇，遵时集观台。\n多惭远臣贱，不得礼容陪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛存诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}